# Banking Transactions API — sample requests
#
# Use with the VS Code "REST Client" extension (or JetBrains HTTP Client):
# click "Send Request" above each block. Requests run top-to-bottom; the
# create requests below seed the data used by the balance / interest calls.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000

### Health check
GET {{baseUrl}}/

### Task 1 — Create a transaction (deposit into ACC-12345)
POST {{baseUrl}}/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fromAccount": "ACC-00000",
  "toAccount": "ACC-12345",
  "amount": 1000.00,
  "currency": "USD",
  "type": "deposit"
}

### Task 1 — Create a transfer out of ACC-12345
POST {{baseUrl}}/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fromAccount": "ACC-12345",
  "toAccount": "ACC-67890",
  "amount": 250.50,
  "currency": "USD",
  "type": "transfer"
}

### Task 1 — Create a withdrawal from ACC-12345
POST {{baseUrl}}/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fromAccount": "ACC-12345",
  "toAccount": "ACC-99999",
  "amount": 100.00,
  "currency": "USD",
  "type": "withdrawal"
}

### Task 1 — List all transactions
GET {{baseUrl}}/transactions

### Task 1 — Get a single transaction by id (replace <id>)
GET {{baseUrl}}/transactions/<id>

### Task 1 — Get account balance (per currency)
GET {{baseUrl}}/accounts/ACC-12345/balance

### Task 3 — Filter by account
GET {{baseUrl}}/transactions?accountId=ACC-12345

### Task 3 — Filter by type
GET {{baseUrl}}/transactions?type=transfer

### Task 3 — Filter by date range
GET {{baseUrl}}/transactions?from=2024-01-01&to=2026-12-31

### Task 3 — Combine filters
GET {{baseUrl}}/transactions?accountId=ACC-12345&type=withdrawal

### Task 4B — Simple interest on current balance
GET {{baseUrl}}/accounts/ACC-12345/interest?rate=0.05&days=30

### Task 2 — Validation error (400): negative amount, bad accounts/currency/type
POST {{baseUrl}}/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fromAccount": "12345",
  "toAccount": "ACC-67890",
  "amount": -5,
  "currency": "XYZ",
  "type": "purchase"
}
